# the forms wiki/syntax.md shows that wap does not build yet: each red line is a to-do, fixed by building the form
# (its Fibonacci `fib(it-1) + fib it - 2`; the argument's extent as wiki/Footguns.md "Braceless argument extent" decides)
use "check.wap"

tenfold := it * 10
check("a braceless argument after + takes the arithmetic after it", 1 + tenfold 3-1, 21)
check("a braceless argument after * takes the arithmetic after it", 2 * tenfold 3-1, 40)
